# CHANGELOG - React Native Wallet

## [1.0.0] - 2026-03-25
### Added
- Autentificare completa cu Clerk (Sign In, Sign Up, OTP)
- Backend RESTful: GET/POST/DELETE /api/transactions
- Sumar financiar: sold, venituri, cheltuieli
- Rate limiting cu Upstash Redis (100 req/10s/IP)
- FlatList performant cu RefreshControl
- Componente: BalanceCard, TransactionItem, PageLoader

## [0.2.0] - 2026-03-18
### Added
- useTransactions hook cu Promise.all pentru fetch paralel
- Endpoint /api/health pentru monitoring Render
- Cron job pentru prevenirea spin-down pe Render free tier

## [0.1.0] - 2026-03-10
### Added
- Structura initiala proiect: backend/ si mobile/
- Configurare PostgreSQL schema (users, transactions)
- Configurare Clerk si Expo Router
